* Device models used by the Bloom SPICE study (ngspice 44).
* JFETs: copied from vendor-derived libraries; LTspice-only params
* (Isr N Nr Alpha Vk M Xti mfg) removed because ngspice level-1 JFET ignores/rejects them.
* 2N3819 - Vishay model as distributed in LTspice standard.jft
*   source: https://github.com/evenator/LTSpice-Libraries/blob/master/cmp/standard.jft
.model 2N3819 NJF(Beta=1.304m Rd=1 Rs=1 Lambda=2.25m Vto=-3 Is=33.57f Cgd=1.6p Pb=1 Fc=.5 Cgs=2.414p)
* 2N5457 - Motorola Small-Signal Databook model (MCE 7-10-95)
*   source: https://www.diyaudio.com/community/threads/pspice-for-2n5457.230743/
.model 2N5457 NJF(VTO=-1.8 BETA=1.35m LAMBDA=1m RD=35 RS=31.5 CGS=2.25p CGD=6p)
* 2N5486 - Siliconix model as distributed in LTspice standard.jft
.model 2N5486 NJF(Is=.25p Vto=-4.0 Beta=4.0m Lambda=10m Rd=10 Rs=10 Cgs=4p Cgd=4p)
* Generic small-signal silicon diode (1N4148-class; stands in for the SSL 1S44)
.model DSIG D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n)
